note The trigger: each row of the Paths list is a PATH_ROW numbered by the path's slot. A click queues OpenPath with the Path tab, which apply hands to open_path once the frame is built. The row shows the name, then kind, author and step count dimmed; the name is red and 'n stale' follows when a step is stale, and marked + or ~ when the map diff has the path as added or changed.
